{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-18T03:50:49.590Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"596c556c2cee537407898227","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-18T03:50:49.590Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Corrected focused suite passes 16/16. All three new modules measured 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines in the dedicated coverage run. Final policy regressions cover unqualified streaming, changed schemas, missing channels, removal of calibration, model replacement during inference and stricter explicit confidence flags. Calibration defaults to 100 requests (evaluation 40), because a 40-case split cannot reach the 0.9 one-sided precision bound even if perfect. No live target or standard was lowered. SDK operation IDs are invocation-scoped so reapplying an intentionally removed calibration is not mistaken for replay. Compatibility inspection confirms the declared host floor exports both repeatable flags and audited settings mutation; dependency pins and release policy remain unchanged. The first full npm gate passed 184 tests but failed coverage during edits; the first Bun gate exposed a synthetic operation-ID replay bug and missing streaming branches. Those are corrected; neither failed gate is counted as a pass. Final isolated full gates follow."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-18T03:50:49.590Z"}],"before_hash":"ecdb8fef762c240219a5220a927da8eebe678b53fb9794f5682c2fbb756203fd","after_hash":"8e6ae5535a70046872f1bab611bd985b8ec509de75265e48e1b725593a4017c4","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"eb395913b4d3714bea3b1e646c27a1245466d222b98f73550236471685219b0b"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-18T04:08:49.561Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"596c556c2cee537407898227","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-18T04:08:49.561Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Final isolated release gates pass through the pinned pm runner: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each run 185/185 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos. Native Node and c8 both report 100 percent lines, branches, functions and statements across all 15 authored sources. Duplication is zero, production audit reports zero findings, changelog checks pass and publication attestation remains valid. The earlier native function gap was a threshold-sort comparator never exercised by uniform synthetic probabilities; mixed-confidence cases now verify selection of the highest-coverage qualifying threshold. Strict tracker health passes with required merge drivers and valid workspace history. Test-result tracking is disabled by existing project policy; these comments retain the sanitized receipts without changing that policy. The release-enable variable is absent and workflow defaults remain disabled. Follow-up pm-jev-w1zj records partial receipts and explicit call counts after endpoint interruption; no incomplete calibration is saved."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-18T04:08:49.561Z"}],"before_hash":"8e6ae5535a70046872f1bab611bd985b8ec509de75265e48e1b725593a4017c4","after_hash":"22362df69aa3037dff64aec7a58484c27242f05989a4a57b8f9e61e5dafc820f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resol